<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="da76872ace46437693e02b1ba5334415">说明：画布 - 熔断配置</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="691eb0d2ee7d4ca6b617b4f99899e80d" />
<h1 nodeId="521078be02244468a21603cc8f5ea320">一、背景</h1>
<p nodeId="89945b30ba8f48a18b4a7ab79df98699">随着业务发展，通过画布部署的近线策略也对熔断功能提出诉求。</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="eb67db4743684a0d822847badd2645c6">Zeus平台定义的熔断功能：当监控对象（场景规则 / 画布组件）命中情况产生异常，达到预设的熔断阈值时，将该对象由人工或系统进行降级（生效转标记 / 组件阻断），以此规避风险。画布熔断即为在画布中，支持用户对其中部分组件进行熔断配置，通过熔断能力监控其执行情况，达到阈值告警用户，可一键将该组件的运行状态变为阻断。</p>
<p nodeId="6ac3e88f33b6416281cdc52feff89e7f">过去，熔断功能仅支持实时链路中，场景-规则模式部署的策略，现在能力进一步扩展到近线链路的画布中。</p>
<h1 align="start" nodeId="b4774207567749878c40ed630cf2192c">二、名词解释</h1>
<h2 nodeId="9a057bc8c5464dc78e6d19ae91fa545f">2.1 概念</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="36a2cb3cf3c8435c950b2ea4dae7e17a">
<tr nodeId="9b63c71548d84bf3b5afddcdf706ea3e">
<th colwidth="[96]" nodeId="24e6bff0996744589ece2f0e66bbb562">
<p nodeId="cc4ddf34f26a43909b46c8c60d6c51ca">名词</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[759]" nodeId="ae2ef1fd343f4b6e9b305bb7c219fc97">
<p nodeId="a0449f13489e4aa194c16934d5375b72">解释</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="ab3fcbda9cf94bb0a3c1fe23c63b9211">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="e19937421b2b48d89ced0f0346eca7a4">
<p nodeId="3455821cd0e74582bf368bba42cc9a70">画布</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[759]" nodeId="340a8a5d21414aaf85ffc5a21cde407e">
<p nodeId="b20f6344f38f4ba2aaf53d9445ab89cf">策略部署的一种模式，用户可以在画布中通过拖拽的方式自定义配置一条数据处理流，以多个数据源组件作为起始，以多个决策类组件作为终止。当用户完成策略的配置之后，画布会自动生成一个flink任务用来执行用户所配置的逻辑。<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200688659" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200688659" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="1db05012c0dd4e33a8556396a37836b3">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200688659</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="aea896c832204fe9bec135d09fbdd431">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="d77bff852617409fa0321476c79cc03c">
<p nodeId="0da1169360e340bb966f20e0a9e1baaf">组件</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[759]" nodeId="d9a287413b1a496fadc8576d7afb9d27">
<p align="start" nodeId="b73232dd1f2f41fe9ed82f8d64f050e6">组成画布的功能块，包括常规的流数据处理（join,groupby,distinct，数据拆分等）逻辑判断（if-else等），规则与自定义代码执行，决策（金丝雀告警，落kafka，丢弃等）。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="8e882ce847c64fe0add8ab19c9b5f320">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="66753e52ed1645f0b63db00bc4b634c9">
<p nodeId="7da57022c1de45b9a8a61783e4ead637">熔断配置</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[759]" nodeId="12470dbf6e8942588839d54433109b99">
<p nodeId="2fb66e97ff5940ce8123a25cd2ce34b5">基于画布组件/组件内规则 配置的熔断内容，包括熔断对象（组件/组件内的规则）、熔断作用时间、熔断监控规则、告警人等。</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2 nodeId="05b2416371364ce88650ad973bdef26e">2.2 各组件的熔断语义</h2>
<p nodeId="29b3f45f0af946f0b0aac488dd2d4222">目前，画布熔断 支持下方5种组件的熔断配置</p>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="e99975231d60441399585431c3b27754">
<tr nodeId="a4e0637d3f2e4828a030ff170b89dcc5">
<th colwidth="[50]" nodeId="6146964a54ba4bd2aa6036c946f78ccd">
<p nodeId="846a1f50a05d4e359186407d256ce47f" />
</th>
<th colwidth="[128]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="af4785f762f84033b7288897f5f6805e">
<p nodeId="8ef2c3a87750404585b30e4f083602e8">组件</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[96]" nodeId="50cd970cd7ba4096af42f74f9ef80977">
<p nodeId="9cfecc37f99246f1865599a2a015b556">组件类型</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[434]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="2de2e935727947b0bd64692326dbe003">
<p nodeId="1648772570ef4334abcc4a64e1405178">熔断语义</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[299]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="90c9feaa45d94f83b52ccbca14453ab4">
<p nodeId="80bece422e06481d97e7f5248eadfb1d">配置</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="3c3481ffbefa45fb902134373f74b324">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="4272e93eb116496493c11119e81f758e">
<p nodeId="322db8f0070848e3a9c0c2a14df7bcbd" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[128]" nodeId="78747fa2926f49cdb591f370b3debdd4">
<p nodeId="30a1e7f4d1834015ad76bc6ab2e2ac88">规则集合组件</p>
</td>
<td rowspan="2" colwidth="[96]" nodeId="f04dee0a93c0463da9bf3a85ffc86656">
<p nodeId="72e9df2c8f074210ae6e58fca2e5995d">自定义</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[434]" nodeId="d0ba531271f34bcfb6bb3d081299b921">
<p nodeId="3fac113139a14c6882096fa40d5328dd">根据规则集合组件中该条【规则】的<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">【命中量】</span>判断是否达到阈值而熔断，使流量在<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">【输入】</span>该组件后<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">不再执行该规则</span>。</p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="62d9b921bde743d7b832f33ac648482b">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="e6c3baa9b1f740498c0a8045982f8134"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">若组件中所有规则都被熔断后，该组件就完全熔断，即流量在</span><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">【输入】</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">该组件前被阻断。</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[299]" nodeId="36502ade6e2149909139d40ec3f265bd">
<p nodeId="0c18d3f0b777404d972b707f7e27fd7c">需要指定画布ID、组件ID和<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">规则ID</span>。</p>
<p nodeId="09f4f662ec93468ea4509610df4d3233"><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">不支持条件过滤，默认含义为某条规则的命中量。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="a2d558156ab04f4dbfb78382faa5ef9d">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="c044364e2f724179a94619a01d479ede">
<p nodeId="3dcd53ec75c44d5dad2e5eb3ecedd230" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[128]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="04f275409136413a8d1f94a1ae0c6013">
<p align="start" nodeId="a4c8af8d7d304c1498daec5728bc40a5">代码组件</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[434]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="b73283b1d9cb4cddab5ca7210ddae2c7">
<p align="start" nodeId="77678d9b5a554d78b88a03810bd7133c">根据代码组件<span color="#FF4A47">【输出】</span>的【流量数】判断是否达到阈值而熔断，使流量在<span color="#FF4A47">【输入】</span>该组件前被阻断。</p>
</td>
<td rowspan="4" colwidth="[299]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="35be51a63e964cc1bc2d302e5e35d070">
<p align="start" nodeId="a8dff77fa8ed4eed9e7e7babda47c693">需要指定画布ID、组件ID<br />条件过滤可选全量或自定义输入。</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="169bb6b13a264aefac9b8c51049feb65" />
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="439e1d03955640109f59f209e7976e98">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="1c0098c4337a4316befbd551f7f2bb3d">
<p nodeId="5202d5c8c5314e45935b1f99131f32a3" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[128]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="908b93a2a7fc4fb2a4110d16719076fe">
<p align="start" nodeId="62234dedbb4c401bba3e3eaac505eea8">旁路输出组件</p>
</td>
<td rowspan="2" colwidth="[96]" nodeId="aa00ea89e16842b784cf0e3ab8fbcfb3">
<p nodeId="e251cb29a98e48598e24c12b9579f05d">数据输出</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[434]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="b82db1117c214866a896e8a04ce58b5a">
<p align="start" nodeId="8f6d2a03e6854fa8ba68b21b26e196b2">根据旁路输出组件<span color="#FF4A47">【输出】</span>到MQ的【流量数】判断是否达到阈值而熔断，使后续流量的<span color="#FF4A47">【输出】</span>被阻断。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="49e5f2c3027b4e87a8da77402005bcb3">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="26fef776225d403c832f3129d28d1106">
<p nodeId="29b72f102c41458fb7dc6f71f21be6af" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[128]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="6fca2b41535447e9a9f788c2a864be2d">
<p align="start" nodeId="06407434523447a28d2634eee429d683">数据存储组件</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[434]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="99e78a01175b4bf5b209e6d7411a311c">
<p align="start" nodeId="c32b15802ffc492aab06521ed55207fb">根据输出存储组件<span color="#FF4A47">【写入】</span>到存储的【流量数】判断是否达到阈值而熔断，使后续数据的<span color="#FF4A47">【写入】</span>被阻断。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="4d6924007d69422f8da2d36d255ada77">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="34f4a0c0a78e47b7bc6e8dc1549362c4">
<p nodeId="abf32f02a4f949cfbcb07897eea2e5db" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[128]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="65bc29b850cf4f3c9df60023902b6e25">
<p align="start" nodeId="3c5cba47562b4e269140f582fa824da1">决策信息组件</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="89e3724c1cf343ef83fec110f8de5dc6">
<p nodeId="4b35bfee918d476483d2c4b06c4a41f6">决策处置</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[434]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="4dbcc7fbf7ab4722bd8ec5834277bff0">
<p align="start" nodeId="09855e478bbc4a6d9df5aa306139c2d7">根据决策信息组件<span color="#FF4A47">【输出】</span>给告警平台/MQ的【流量数】判断是否达到阈值而熔断，使后续流量的<span color="#FF4A47">【输出】</span>被阻断。</p>
</td>
</tr>
