<h1 align="start" nodeId="a5ba175b9eb14f6897955a881a098c2c">三、操作指南</h1>
<h2 nodeId="01f08098d5794e0bbeeaaeb0b1c9f58a">3.1 操作流程图</h2>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4071270726?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="528" height="351" nodeId="50a890ec1572476082a00c6372a6b13f" />
<h2 nodeId="b01379baa6b14c80b25b96d600130598">3.2 详细步骤</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="10f0124b7e724590b8e61058064cc21c">
<tr nodeId="64f2fddcb07d4d178cc835182c6a2325">
<th colwidth="[119]" nodeId="8c4070df91a2411c898ca0f6d93c546f">
<p nodeId="b092a9e073ec49ea814a471b401d0396">模块</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[499]" nodeId="a40185f6e8084e7e93614bfa5a5a70cb">
<p nodeId="2526b10cb0bb4105b42cf4a728fb6fdb">说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[607]" nodeId="8d59ef42e2d444579bad2736c6d0dd4b">
<p nodeId="f26b85b5665948b0a92a2988ff1a5808">图例</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="21e6a780fe1b4173bae974937549f60c">
<td colwidth="[119]" nodeId="5388de1dc7d44b3a97b978e73b8af3dd">
<p nodeId="8f0a367b74fb4dfe8f698f538470328e">熔断配置入口</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[499]" nodeId="a1c2138539674556b03eb09dbabdee35">
<p nodeId="4be9d5f9cd404f7ea917bb8cc44805f6">在画布详情预览页，选择需要配置熔断的组件。在组件详情中，点击熔断配置，将打开熔断配置页。</p>
<p nodeId="b646041221ce4f29952c3b2ba100e84d"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">画布熔断新建的唯一入口是从画布中打开，不支持在熔断菜单页进行画布熔断的新建。</span></p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="d44aef0a24c14f879427685a93d00673">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="a935cbb2c03548d7a5039862521242ea">画布熔断只对画布ID当前的<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">生效版本</span>作用。</p>
<ul nodeId="340b44e583364cc1bb172a05f95beef7">
<li nodeId="ad1fb4542baf4f9e8955f2f16c5eefd2">若切换生效版本后，原来配置熔断的组件不再存在（被删除），则该熔断配置也<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">不再有效</span>。</li>
<li nodeId="a9d3bf2c9b3d452a96df006c6e84e2d9">若切换生效版本后，原来配置熔断的组件的内容有变更，熔断配置依旧有效，<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">用户需确认熔断配置内容也同样适配</span>，以免出现不符合预期的报出。</li>
</ul>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" nodeId="61c34c0f5a8f48739f0f2d4943604948">
<p nodeId="87c9fa7a174e425a9c3e6560061b1f27"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4008238164?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="952.47" height="600" nodeId="aaa447610dec4d72b264193a00334a9f" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="d8ff3f69a4e548958547a3cb90a034dd">
<td colwidth="[119]" nodeId="9ee7a78cd9854c129bd61a7f89b1988f">
<p nodeId="e10540dced6441ffadea81e9bcc70207">画布熔断配置</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[499]" nodeId="2af3e4d01fbb4efc8eaefa25851f2393">
<p nodeId="037e1572405c40778a365d7b27924661"><strong>1.熔断名称</strong>可编辑，熔断模式、作用范围默认已经选好当前组件，不可更改。</p>
<p nodeId="8099af04459943bc98dda225436706a0"><strong>2.过滤条件</strong>：默认全量计数，即所有流出该组件的数据都会进行计数。用户可根据需要选择条件过滤模式，输入aviator表达式作为过滤条件。执行时，满足表达式的数据，才会进行熔断计数。如图中，当<span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)">userid 不为空时候 ，才计数。</span></p>
<p nodeId="34fb07d1cb284e96aded8355a7fd6c3f"><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><strong>3.作用时间</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)">：可选择熔断监控的时间范围，</span>系统将在设置的作用时间内检查数据，从而触发熔断；</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="48d7eca105ec4ac59aea3abc495e93a3">时间类型包括：自由时间段（自由选择时间范围）与星期模式（设置每天的统一时间段，自由选择一周中的星期数）。</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="66eb852b73de41c59bab836b5ec60b77">勾选排除节假日后，节假日不检查数据，例如设置了周六，同时勾选了排除节假日，则周六不检查数据</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="7be3d6a05d784af584338a54053101d9">添加作用时间：以‘和’的逻辑关系增加作用时间，即可通过添加多条作用时间，获得一个作用时间的并集。</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="fbe1ac97d9854740a1b19263677092ae"><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><strong>4.熔断规则</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)">：以且条件（添加子规则）和或条件（添加熔断规则）来组织。</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="d5f9b5b28a5c44e6bde0e9bf56e3db79">单条熔断规则需要设置如下项：</p>
<ul nodeId="1a05c3b2775f4d9f9bf070bc0a805f55">
<li nodeId="ea80a5ce6d2d40d1960868cf379bdfec">
<p align="start" nodeId="4e00ff61e0ac4403ad7bd22ea967158e">时间周期（最近x分钟）：默认1分钟，支持输入</p>
</li>
<li nodeId="4f2325f66e81441aa532ce1f2f1e1f6c">
<p align="start" nodeId="27951c5713be46a79b60879071b3e308">计算函数：<span color="">下拉列表选择，默认选择“命中量”，其余计算函数见下方附表。</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="ced5a9a3376f4f08af37f984a80eca63">
<p align="start" nodeId="eb9465772f90451b9410a1661feab48e">对比关系：<span color="">下拉列表选择，&gt;, &gt;=, =, &lt;, &lt;=，默认为“&gt;=”</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="61887ffe77934617aef0de82ecffb78d">
<p align="start" nodeId="bfa2b3f6c0e248d0839356113b1b6aaf">阈值：<span color="">直接输入数值，系统根据指标匹配单位</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p nodeId="05ef1e3cbb2c400392e625fe06e2341f"><strong>5.熔断动作</strong></p>
<p nodeId="319591fd69764fc3be95cc1b1f9d7da5">人工熔断：方式为达到阈值产生大象告警，人工可点击一键熔断将组件进行熔断。</p>
<p nodeId="ac55bb5aa76549eb850b10aab8e4584a">频次上限：默认无。可配置按间隔，每一次通知发送后的设置时间间隔内，不发送触发的熔断告警通知。</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="2554b5cd1f734801ac9003edccf97723">通知人<strong>：</strong>可选择业务空间负责人、业务空间变更通知人、自定义。自定义：支持手动输入mis号，多个使用英文逗号隔开</p>
<km-note type="warning" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="670657b199f24dc4964a6ca383cb2cd2">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="d1fe6612d5ad4ebda744b81f8b05862d">当前配置熔断的同学若希望收到熔断告警，别忘记在自定义中加上自己的mis号～</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" nodeId="942d42747a484a48a949f44ca3d4369f">
<p nodeId="4f31be9ba84248f19f1df409d2d9581c"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4007449252?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="926.54" height="600" nodeId="34e4d8cdc5d546f6b0580615613eff99" /></p>
<p nodeId="4932626e52044f35a2b206368b0811cf"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4020116351?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="871" height="600" nodeId="e9de9005513b4ac18b8061df0bd65012" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="39a3dee3520544dc9af6623026a51a69">
<td colwidth="[119]" nodeId="136858f1a17149c3bd652f8fddcbd85d">
<p nodeId="9363bcde476c4dc8a81768912e212cc3">熔断配置列表</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[499]" nodeId="ae05dee9773c49b2a9bd4a2fa2f82419">
<p nodeId="d002ea34fb9d47acb4fdc62e450723c0">提交完成配置后，将会在熔断配置列表出现一条配置记录。</p>
<p nodeId="42d3299f2d2b416cb5148786f7c4f12b">熔断模式：单点熔断 （场景-规则）/  画布熔断（画布-组件）</p>
<p nodeId="1a5181351cab4d8483a1809d97a220ff">单点熔断的一二三级范围代表：场景-规则-决策</p>
<p nodeId="c2c8e047e4504aa6bd66d59c782fb9d5">画布熔断的一二三级范围代表：画布-组件-规则（-1代表无，规则集合组件的熔断才会有对应id）</p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="f62b2d71922d4cf085fc880a399d1248">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="1a1045fb17b341bc9845b1a2f30416cd">记得在此处拨亮状态开关，开启熔断监控的状态！熔断才会正式运作。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" nodeId="1401bf9a7d9c46d896a74d5a10b425b2">
<p nodeId="bb3dcb8f38a34ccb84d9d23bc9a94d72"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4071198664?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1122.42" height="600" nodeId="33353d8d55424c1892277ef44d87fdac" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="965fb92e50a2455380566a6c782ccd51">
<td colwidth="[119]" nodeId="cead4c87880244028e7a955a9c8ce166">
<p nodeId="92dbcbf736194317b357e99887850bdb">画布预览页</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[499]" nodeId="986d5775519043e98875a16ec798c5e0">
<p nodeId="87f73c89465c4b83a93e7f846dd712fc">配置了熔断的组件，在画布预览中（记得更新一下），可以看到组件后方有一个【火焰状】的标识符。表明该组件目前已经有对应的熔断配置。</p>
<p nodeId="c3133fe458bc4e0baece7e3044809a74">组件详情中，右上角由配置熔断变为【查看熔断】，同时出现组件状态开关。默认为：<span color="#FF4A47">执行中，不可拨动。</span></p>
<p nodeId="1bccd6887e624cedb14dd4f87374ef98" />
<p nodeId="a044cd8d4b3743129c3342cb6d52d723"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">当熔断触发，用户点击一键熔断后，会使组件置灰，不再执行，此时组件状态变为关闭态。</span></p>
<p nodeId="6e9da418331b4561aa5437a997ac6a96"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">用户调整完有问题的策略后，手动将组件状态拨为执行中。即可再次使组件进入执行，并恢复熔断监控。</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" nodeId="c270178cb0b744ea976eabee3c8cff60">
<p nodeId="b14feeb32d37448ba62fd80ccaee36f6"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4010804407?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1053.11" height="600" nodeId="6bd182ea959346e6a391304d1a59f6a1" /></p>
<p nodeId="84556bb91bea416497f30c24df33cdb0"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4024076359?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1011" height="508.16" nodeId="e3b49a8138914838b0a9ca87ab206b88" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="1cf3aad131a34aa5b9d5d3a233a07ef9">
<td colwidth="[119]" nodeId="1eb497a86f71420894510d8cdb2f355d">
<p nodeId="9054fcac643f4b3ea5d2d747b5ab4c87">大象通知</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[499]" nodeId="1b9e091ec5734de7b7b2550b6feba371">
<p nodeId="de572394ec754ce1a4a381db1c51e8f2">如右图展示的是大象通知的内容</p>
<p nodeId="22386cf0af744ea8b011aa2daa0d1b0b">【监控单位流量】即为对应组件在过去时间周期内的计数。</p>
<p nodeId="a25a7bcaa8d64134b81acd11d2eda80d">点击【一键熔断】可直接使该组件不再执行。</p>
<p nodeId="a8a5d8001fb6472a97cdf13950df3db1">点击【熔断记录 】可打开zeus熔断的记录详情</p>
<p nodeId="7f37a1c4772645c08bb25d32cd628500">点击【画布详情】可打开zeus画布的详情预览页</p>
<p nodeId="bb0f87ce8b9c4a95ac512fcab6324dee">点击【熔断ID/名称】可打开zeus熔断配置预览页</p>
<p nodeId="b5c47dee22b1465b9d71db95b2acafd7">点击【ACK】可使熔断在对应时间内不再反复告出。</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" nodeId="66ee00263d3f427fa44b541406ad091a">
<p nodeId="b3cc2ea365cd458aad071a1722df9983"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4024430281?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="310" height="344" nodeId="87a2c4cfbee34af5aaa3061e9082674d" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
