<h2 nodeId="233467efca1d491f86dd1503dd1b7a69">3.3 规则集合组件的熔断配置</h2>
<p nodeId="0e09613b597c4d78a1b6c3e44b869af7">规则集合组件和其他组件的熔断语义有些区别，即：根据规则集合组件中该条【规则】的<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">【命中量】</span>判断是否达到阈值而熔断，使流量在<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">【输入】</span>该组件后<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">不再执行该规则</span>。</p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="a36b72621fe84ea9ae7c17aa19e3cd84">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="34c73a56463b4f979f2195d576212fb0"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">若组件中所有规则都被熔断后，该组件就完全熔断，即流量在</span><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">【输入】</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">该组件前被阻断。</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="1c277843953f4a72a1050b541640a5e2">
<tr nodeId="10303c1ec8144ca38b27d00c9bd4618e">
<th colwidth="[119]" nodeId="aab0458672ac48cc867d92823194f42f">
<p nodeId="f4190a1388ad495487bab4e501679cd0">模块</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[529]" nodeId="0a73ac4d7ca8445cbdb20dee5cafc1ae">
<p nodeId="109ef2909f6641c2954439459f1a1187">说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[587]" nodeId="1cd759630a2b4f7a9da4818bbb05aeb4">
<p nodeId="e9d5bcbf24a24b3c95d503c1f48ba949">图例</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="8e5922a00ba34d3280ab60694ce5d499">
<td colwidth="[119]" nodeId="a5d110f16994499981da7d0efce4bd33">
<p nodeId="70cf0f1ef023438392244494f7fa6f29">熔断配置入口</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[529]" nodeId="93b7dc971c8b483ea51d8b552989dcc1">
<p nodeId="dabf98320bc646a0b96f4fe97642039c">在画布详情预览页，选择需要配置熔断的 规则集合组件。</p>
<p nodeId="40550a0967d6404fbded266c3dc76fd7">在组件详情中，在对应规则后方，点击熔断配置，将打开熔断配置页；</p>
<p nodeId="d36b17106377445eb98acfe72fe3d5f3">若组件下配置的是规则组，支持对规则组中的规则快速全选全部规则 创建熔断逻辑，也支持单条规则配置熔断。</p>
<p nodeId="c03a649799c641d2a79c7cca14ed5963" />
<p nodeId="7fa13381b6de40faa7814f3c7113d9f9"><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">注：画布熔断新建的唯一入口是从画布中打开，不支持在熔断菜单页进行画布熔断的新建。</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[587]" nodeId="eeeaa563056044d78e10da049ab0a434">
<p nodeId="4747b6204797485eaa9e23203b8c8bce"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4072781640?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="942.32" height="600" nodeId="d001d65aec044f1c83389dabd9e69dcb" /></p>
<p nodeId="49a160fc8e22422fbe799e1b09119b6b"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/21185063796?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="551" height="376" nodeId="ff8dee51e01347d190775c6446b7e756" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="0261fdd522484129a1b2fed82c917a42">
<td colwidth="[119]" nodeId="3efa70f30d8441eb9f54961cf7917022">
<p nodeId="c333e4196a684508947671434c1a471d">画布熔断配置</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[529]" nodeId="29464e8b426c407483634b57b6d07c68">
<p nodeId="116f100114404bb8a28463afbd0d3120">熔断配置页与其他组件类似，此处不赘述。</p>
<p nodeId="d36eb8ec87f44a449eb5ef3919a59422">仅下述区别：</p>
<p nodeId="f185a7eb093a4f1d91c5a618a0714e50"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">1.不支持条件过滤，默认含义为某条规则的命中量。</span></p>
<p nodeId="4efc8a973540496592de208cf61367f8"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">2.需要选择配置熔断的规则，默认选中入口所属规则，也可多选该组件中</span><span color="#FF4A47">还未配置熔断</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">的其他规则。</span></p>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="3a41b61f7e9b45dda2658ff5615b7bf4">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="19aa9c318017439d857202bfa8622f6e"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">多选的含义：针对选择的多条规则，</span><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">分别</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">按照下方的配置进行熔断监控。</span><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">注意，不是计算多条规则的命中总和，而是分别计算命中。</span>共享下方的熔断规则、通知等配置。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="d2d9502a14db4db48ee4bf449a497228" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[587]" nodeId="bb0ef9181c124b9083d21a4a0eb5aadc">
<p nodeId="5305258af6f041528319f6d04a2abdac"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4071054578?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="958.94" height="600" nodeId="20c15614b39447c88b21289b2a49d856" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="56a4dabaf4994885abaaf248bb7775e4">
<td colwidth="[119]" nodeId="20729797232d48a69da5170bde2cb0c0">
<p nodeId="4807630aea1140808933e4594dd51539">其他</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[529]" nodeId="7514ef995a4a4edf94a57afe69e97bce">
<p nodeId="b6f34f2ffd494f3dbaca3c01045da1f1">1.完成配置后，列表会出现熔断配置记录。</p>
<p nodeId="41355cff99f24560b9a7c0c3fe0ab62e">在画布预览-组件详情中（记得更新一下），对应规则后方由【配置熔断】变为【查看熔断】，同时出现组件状态开关。默认为：<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">执行中，不可拨动。</span></p>
<p nodeId="6b07349146b64b93bd8e079b800accf3"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">2.当熔断触发，用户点击一键熔断后，会使流量经过组件时，不再执行</span><span color="#FF4A47">该规则</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">，此时组件状态变为【关闭态】。</span></p>
<p nodeId="0b2daaca16754b03b07100d574925082"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">3.若组件中所有规则都被熔断后，该组件就完全熔断，即流量在</span><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">【输入】</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">该组件前被阻断。</span></p>
<p nodeId="425dfb5ff36c406fb8c661789ecf7e52"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">4.用户调整完有问题的策略后，手动将规则状态拨为执行中。即可再次使规则进入执行，并恢复熔断监控。</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[587]" nodeId="e3364ccf28fb47a5b855354bcc056f70">
<p nodeId="11ac4fec30934802a02cab9f42195501"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1354627337/4199019122?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1100" height="600" nodeId="cab5fab0fde1451f8f7c258f399c7759" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h1 nodeId="7f2fce53daaa4a8daf6f19026d50f389">四、FAQ</h1>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="fb4252d9610146739c1b2b6c63bb58a5">
<tr nodeId="da739a8e6e974f4fbecab701c632b25f">
<th colwidth="[50]" nodeId="66414fc6f0564ebab49e365aef1b10a5">
<p nodeId="d0ca8df4b0fe49c8bd4e6b2638d0fd84" />
</th>
<th colwidth="[282]" nodeId="8e0204ef1a0b4d0e92979939a0a1b96b">
<p nodeId="3d30c2766b7445aba1cc5cc368c90cee">问题</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[827]" nodeId="6b2ba828024e4de4bcdcffea488b71ce">
<p nodeId="6ccc50e1a61c4ed78d340985fdc8e5c3">答</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="90f62420d55641f2a97d157bbd3d2dc0">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="3287ca31aeb84519b6dfd04f13c01912">
<p nodeId="233629c6e199424ca93ed74783469046" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[282]" nodeId="2ba9ee6a552a4b3ca15844a37e897c10">
<p nodeId="226541ebaf9248a7a45ea70084506b09">画布切换版本后，原来组件的熔断配置如何处理？</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[827]" nodeId="9ff807628b924a8c82cb25d4a6f7af50">
<p nodeId="2b7854fff60e49b0855e36d5cdf7f947">画布熔断只对画布ID当前的<span color="#FF4A47">生效版本</span>作用。</p>
<ul nodeId="fb8db685de2f4841bbd4684681e2214d">
<li nodeId="244c55b00fc5451db9be69f26dbb2c5c">若切换生效版本后，原来配置熔断的组件不再存在（被删除），则该熔断配置也<span color="#FF4A47">不再有效</span>（但还在配置列表里躺着）</li>
<li nodeId="1f2c1279cf6a4315b225bfb2169dfd67">若切换生效版本后，原来配置熔断的组件的内容有变更，熔断配置依旧有效，<span color="#FF4A47">需要用户确认熔断配置内容也同样适配</span>，以免出现不符合预期的报出。</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="3dd3583717044cddb4e4ede88bad1d09">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="7011bddcec1d4a22a86216674509f730">
<p nodeId="b051ed74fc534bbeb68be06d31bb6b52" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[282]" nodeId="30ce4f7d48c4423b8979602ac8ff1370">
<p nodeId="cf1a021ca7dd4fa0af3a625c65f74011">画布熔断配置 支持复制么？</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[827]" nodeId="78cafdd514a2420a83034e3c9920c60c">
<p nodeId="bd969b1fe7ee46428b80f11ad0169eb7">不支持，一个配置对应一个画布组件。</p>
<p nodeId="e6e829669ce14409bc5e94d76c6f6bad">其中规则集合组件特殊，因其中有多条规则，可能涉及多个熔断配置。但是组件中每条规则最多只能对应1个配置。</p>
<p nodeId="6a49a82d8f5d4e10b0e210b14a5eebc3">（表现为：如果组件里1个规则A配了熔断，就不能在组件内另一个规则<strong>B</strong>配熔断时，下拉多选该条规则A）</p>
</td>
